From: "prompt.ac/@jeffrey" <mail@aesthetic.computer>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 11:43:04 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] NELA optional theme: retro initials avatars, NELA icons and
 styles, theme preference in UiStore

Adds an optional NELA Computer Club look on top of Outline main: shared/styles/nela.ts
theme tokens, NelaStyles/NelaIcons components, RetroInitials avatars, sidebar and
document-title styling, and a Preferences toggle persisted in UiStore, with tests.
